intents-contract/res/

# Cargo.lock IS committed here, overriding the global ignore rule.
#
# Two reasons. OutLayer compiles this example inside the enclave and attests the hash of the
# resulting wasm, so an unpinned dependency graph means the same source can compile to a
# different binary. And the worker's compiler image is Rust 1.85: an unpinned resolve pulls
# icu/idna versions that declare rustc 1.86 as their minimum, and the build fails outright.
!Cargo.lock
